  "description": "XIVZEI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H134 N52 Nd6 O58 8+,3(H3 O1 1+),11(Cl1 1-),29(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd1B (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2B (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd3B (Nd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.753-3.957 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.75-110.02°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C96H201Cl11Nd6N52O90.",
